{"unit_id": "tag:08WW:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在本小节中，固定一个环映射（ring map）<MATH_0001>。如第<REF_0001>节所述，我们可以用余单纯（cosimplicial）代数（algebras）的语言讨论模（modules）的下降（descent）数据（data），但在本小节中更倾向于使用较为具体的术语。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n对<MATH_0002>，令<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>重张量积（tensor product），其中取<MATH_0005>并在<MATH_0006>上进行。定义环（ring）同态（homomorphisms）<MATH_0007>、<MATH_0008>和<MATH_0009>，所用公式为<MATH_0010>。换言之，上标表示来源环（ring），下标表示插入因子（factors）1 的位置。（这一记号（notation）与第<REF_0002>节中引入的记号相容。）\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n回顾<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>确切地说，这里的<MATH_0011>是<MATH_0012>的逆（inverse），后者见定义<REF_0003>。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>定义<REF_0004>：对<MATH_0013>，一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>下降（descent）数据（datum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，定义在<MATH_0014>上且相对于<MATH_0015>，是一个同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0016>，在<MATH_0017>-模（modules）之间，并满足<TEXTITOPEN_0002>上闭链条件（cocycle condition）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002><MATH_0018>。令<MATH_0019>为范畴（category），其对象为<MATH_0020>-模（modules），带有相对于<MATH_0021>的下降（descent）数据（data）。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n例如，对<MATH_0022>，选定一个同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0023>后，通过将<MATH_0024>和<MATH_0025>自然地等同于<MATH_0026>，便得到一个下降（descent）数据（datum）。特别地，这一构造定义了一个函子（functor）<MATH_0027>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "cosimplicial", "target_term": "余单纯"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "tensor product", "target_term": "张量积"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "homomorphisms", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "factors", "target_term": "因子"}, {"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_