{"unit_id": "tag:08WW:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n利用引理<REF_0001>及限制（restriction）函子（functor）<MATH_0001>是基扩张（base extension）函子（functor）<MATH_0002>的右伴随（right adjoint）这一事实，我们推出<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>的右伴随（right adjoint）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n我们已经可以陈述关键引理。在忠实平坦（faithfully flat）的情形下，这是容易得到的（见注<REF_0002>），但在一般情形下则需要一些论证。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "base extension", "target_term": "基扩张"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "right adjoint", "target_term": "右伴随"}, {"source_term": "right adjoint", "target_term": "右伴随"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "限制标量的函子，待决。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "限制及基扩张函子，待决。"}, {"source_term": "base extension", "target_term": "基扩张", "context": "基扩张构造，待决。"}, {"source_term": "right adjoint", "target_term": "右伴随", "context": "两处伴随关系，待决。"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦", "context": "较易情形，待决。"}], "notes": []}
